{"type":"message","id":"c4e250e0","parentId":"96fff838","timestamp":"2026-05-27T03:45:58.596Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The POST /send endpoint is returning error code 1101 (which might be a Cloudflare Workers error). The GET /history endpoints work with X-API-Key header but POST /send doesn't. This seems like the platform's POST endpoint has an issue. Let me check if there's a different issue - maybe the platform has a bug or the endpoint requires additional fields.\n\nLet me try without the threadId in the body, maybe it needs to be a query parameter.\n","thinkingSignature":"ea0d50e969f77c778b57b0b2f282d5a108a2084549ee986c6b3743959783cc2f"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_77spb0ct00ui_1","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"curl -s -X POST \"https://echo-agent-platform.zhouyating.workers.dev/send?threadId=arbitration\" \\\n  -H \"X-API-Key: echo-a…-key\" \\\n  -H \"Content-Type: application/json\" \\\n  -d '{\"content\":\"heartbeat 03:45\"}'"}}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax-portal","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":117,"output":190,"cacheRead":20219,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":20526,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1779853549487,"responseId":"06659beece548a68cf16db1d050c7647"}}
