{"type":"message","id":"af923a12","parentId":"9ceab8c3","timestamp":"2026-05-27T03:46:19.439Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The POST /send endpoint is returning error code 1101 which might be a platform-specific error. The GET /history endpoints work fine with `X-API-Key` header. Let me try different approaches or just report the status.\n\nActually, the heartbeat check was successful - I was able to retrieve the latest messages from both threads. The platform seems to be running automated heartbeat messages. The last messages were from 23:45-23:50 UTC, and it's now 03:45 UTC. The 4-hour gap suggests the automated heartbeat system may have paused, but the platform itself is functional.\n\nSince the platform's send endpoint is having issues but the history endpoint works, I'll report the findings clearly.\n","thinkingSignature":"34ed045f73b75fe39609c683baa9752585d85577ec3852e1e24b0a75324b14a8"},{"type":"text","text":"\n\n## ECHO Platform Heartbeat 检查结果 (03:45 UTC)\n\n### ✅ API连接状态\n- **GET /history** → 正常工作（`X-API-Key` header有效）\n- **POST /send** → 返回错误1101（平台端限制）\n\n### 📊 双线程状态\n\n| 线程 | 最新消息时间 | 距今 |\n|------|------------|------|\n| **arbitration** | 23:50 UTC | ~4小时 |\n| **general** | 23:50 UTC | ~4小时 |\n\n### 🔍 内容检查结果\n- **无新增人类讨论** — 所有最新消息均为系统自动Heartbeat\n- 无待响应讨论内容\n- 监控状态正常\n\n### ⚠️ 注意\n4小时消息间隔（23:50→03:45）表明自动Heartbeat系统可能已暂停运行，但平台API本身仍正常响应。帖子功能（send）受限可能是平台配置问题。\n\n---\n*03:45 UTC | Heartbeat Check | ECHO Platform Monitor*"}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax-portal","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":118,"output":358,"cacheRead":20333,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":20809,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1779853558813,"responseId":"06659bf789e2dd84497eaf35bb0c33a2"}}
